flowchart TD
  S1["<b>Step 1. Simulation, Blocks A and B</b> (288 cells, B = 1,000)<br/>run_grid3_restartable.R, using pe_discriminant_analysis_profile_optimized_5.R<br/>writes grid_final/"]
